WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.701
-Today's Friday and that's
usually when I

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.033
catch up on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:06.100
You know, I check my inbox,
return some e-mails,

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.300
of course send out
thank-you notes.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.033
I was running a bit behind.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:12.634
Would you guys mind if I
write out my thank-you notes

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.834
right now, is that okay?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:16.834
-Uh, James,
could I get some thank-you-note

00:00:16.834 --> 00:00:18.100
writing music, please?

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:22.100
♪♪

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.601
-Wow. Peppy, I don't know.
-Smirking, like the Mona Lisa.

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:29.501
[ Laughter ]
-What is it, yeah.

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:31.067
Is he smiling or not?

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:36.667
-Thank you, NFL Playoffs,
for not being called,

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.434
"are you better than a
50-year-old."

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:41.868
[ Applause ]

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:46.801
I don't know if you are or not.
-Maybe not. [ Laughs ]

00:00:46.801 --> 00:00:50.133
-Thank you,
KFC's Beyond Fried Chicken,

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.534
for being a new fast food
product that doesn't contain

00:00:52.534 --> 00:00:55.133
any actual chicken.
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:56.334
Or as McNuggets put it,

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:58.033
[Southern accent]
"Stay in your lane, girl."

00:00:58.033 --> 00:00:59.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:02.334
Stay in your lane, girl.

00:01:03.934 --> 00:01:05.234
-McRib.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:11.767
-Thank you, gloves, for being
mittens where the fingers

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.567
