really hurting my feelings.

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.968
Neck Spanx?

00:01:33.634 --> 00:01:35.701
-Neck Spanx?
-Face Spanx?

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:37.734
What is face Spanx?
Never heard of them.

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:38.968
Kind of insulting but I could
use them.

00:01:38.968 --> 00:01:40.434
-Like, well I'm definitely gonna
try it.

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.701
-Yeah.
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:46.434
-Thank you, cough drops,
for helping out

00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:48.734
