00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:57.000
-[ Imitates sucking on a candy ]
Crinkle.

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:58.901
-There used to be to --
ah, there's used to be, like,

00:01:58.901 --> 00:02:01.367
