were cough medicine.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:19.834
-Oh, yeah, of course.

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.901
Oh, yeah you'd throw them down
like they're cherry candy.

00:02:21.901 --> 00:02:23.267
I love them.
-Yeah.

00:02:23.267 --> 00:02:24.868
-Oh, I like this one.

00:02:24.868 --> 00:02:26.000
I mean, I haven't
written it yet.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.701
