something good.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:33.601
-It's because
you're so thankful.

00:02:33.601 --> 00:02:35.334
-I'm gonna write something good.
-No, it's good.

00:02:35.334 --> 00:02:37.400
[ Laughter ]
-Grateful, so proud of you.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.934
-Wait, don't let me forget it
now, hold on.

00:02:38.934 --> 00:02:39.934
-Don't forget it, because this
